librats provides the CMake target `rats::rats`:

    find_package(rats CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE rats::rats)

Packaging notes:
- Only the x64-osx and x64-osx-dynamic triplets are built from source; upstream
  does not publish a macOS x64 archive.
- All other supported triplets install the upstream 3.0.6 release archive,
  which contains a single static library (librats.a / rats.lib).
- The release archives are built with the C bindings enabled, the BitTorrent
  search features disabled and the distributed storage module disabled.
  The x64-osx source builds use the same feature set.
- The upstream Windows archive is an MSVC build; MinGW and static-CRT triplets
  are not supported.
